2 delegations: analyst, researcher

Read the two questions the supervisor wrote, not the answer. It had to turn one
user question into two self-contained ones, because neither colleague can see
the original and neither can see the other's reply.

That rewriting is the whole design, and it is also the whole risk: everything
the supervisor fails to put in those questions is information the workers do
not have, and everything it puts in badly is a question they will answer well
and uselessly.
